OL,3,APoet says being dropped from Senedd
OL,4,Aroyal visit over poem is 'concerning'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Senedd Commission said the poem,
OL,7,Fthat Issa had reworked and had already
OL,8,Fbeen translated into Welsh, was "not
OL,9,Fthe right fit for this occasion".
